                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Fun game, a real gem. Found it at my local pharmacy back in the 90's for $5 in a bargain bin, so I bought it, brought it home and fired it up on the family computer, a Pentium II 300Mhz machine. Absolutly loved it on my first playthrough, had many more playthrough until one day our PC died and I never played the game again. Then one day 30 years later I thought of the game, so I looked it up and behold there it was on Steam for a single dollar, so of course I had to buy it again. Never played it sinse buying it again here on Steam, but I'm going to one day here soon.",
